---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { siteFacts } from '../data/site-facts';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Amitoj Singh"
  description={`Amitoj Singh's background and inquiry into ${siteFacts.researchFocus}.`}
>
  <section class="container-zen section-zen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-balance">About</h1>
      <div class="accent-line mb-10"></div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start">
        <img
          src="/images/profile.jpeg"
          alt="Amitoj Singh smiling while seated beside the water, with a city skyline behind him"
          class="w-56 h-72 object-cover object-top"
          width="768"
          height="1024"
        />

        <div>
          <p class="text-lg text-ink-light mb-6">
            I came to this research through {siteFacts.professionalHistory}.
          </p>
          <p class="text-ink-light mb-6">
            I studied {siteFacts.education}. I have practiced yoga for {siteFacts.yogaPractice}.
          </p>
          <p class="text-ink-light">
            The research begins before measurement. A person or organization has already decided what deserves attention, what counts as progress, and which direction is worth holding.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-zen section-zen border-t border-oat-300">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6 section-header">The inquiry</h2>
      <p class="text-ink-light mb-6">
        The question changes with the setting. My years in investing shape the organizational side; coaching stays with one person facing a decision. Yoga makes attention bodily, photography begins with what catches my eye, and writing is where I make the resulting claims public enough to test.
      </p>
      <p class="text-ink-light">
        The work moves between those settings because clarity and action can fail separately. Seeing more does not choose a direction. Holding a direction does not make it right.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-zen section-zen border-t border-oat-300">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6 section-header">Continue</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <a href="/research" class="arrow-link">Research</a>
        <a href="/principles" class="arrow-link">Principles</a>
        <a href="/third-enlightenment" class="arrow-link">Third Enlightenment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
